  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The past of other regular verbs",
   "texto": [
    "Many verbs finished in **-ere** form the past with **-erte**: study → study («estudiar → estudió»). Others add **-de**: øve → øvde («practicar → practicó»). These endings depend on the verb, so it is appropriate to learn them along with their past."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Questions in the past",
   "texto": [
    "The verb also goes first in a question of yes or no: **Studerte du i går?** If the question begins with a question word, the verb goes later: **Hva lærte du?**"
   ]
